Reading: this is shadow-price spectroscopy. A direction can be heavily used in one best cluster yet still be replaceable; a real proof route should track both usage and dropout loss.

Impairment 2: observed direction-support thresholds in exact small witnesses
target_n  exact_edges  support_pairs  support_mask  usage
       6           9             3        {2,3,5}  (0, 0, 4, 2, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0)
