      14          33             7 {1,2,3,5,6,7,8}  (0, 1, 6, 4, 0, 6, 7, 3, 6)
Reading: this is a Helly-style certificate scale for the carrier. Instead of assuming all nine directions are needed, read how many direction orders an exact small witness actually uses.  This is an upper bound on the direction threshold and a guide for later exact subset searches.

